  texts:
  - key: body
    text: "Captain: There's an energy reading near the volcano. I\u2019ll head there.
      You all continue your assigned tasks.\nAssistant: It\u2019s too dangerous to
      go alone!\nProfessor: No objections from me.\nCaptain: We still have the recorder
      to keep us connected. The ship\u2019s failure was my responsibility. I\u2019ll
      find us fuel.\nRecorder: I\u2019ll sync all your collected data to the log
      system. Don\u2019t forget to check your tablets."
